Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 00:48:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] EvoEgg: fly ExpressiveOS's mark and use it as the app icon

ExpressiveOS is its own ROM: the easter egg flew Evolution X's logo and
its icon showed that logo on a blue disc. Draw the four-petal mark with
its petal gradients instead, and the icon as the mark on black.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
